---
import Scribble from './Scribble.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<section class="cover" aria-labelledby="cover-title">
  <div class="wrap cover-grid">
    <div class="cover-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">A case from Kate Terraccino’s work at IBM</p>
      <h1 id="cover-title">Many new LinuxONE clients needed a paid consultant to get a first workload running.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Client research and one internal demo turned that into a funded product team: IBM Launchpad for LinuxONE. The research, the demo, and the people who said yes are all in the write-up.</p>
      <a class="cta" href={`${base}work/nexus/`}>Read how it happened <Scribble name="arrow" /></a>
    </div>
    <ul class="cover-stickers" aria-label="Notes about this case">
      <li><span class="sticker lemon" style="--tilt:-6deg">Case 1 of 3</span></li>
      <li><span class="sticker" style="--tilt:3deg">Proposal → funded team</span></li>
      <li><span class="sticker mint" style="--tilt:-2deg">Figures restricted until GA, so none are claimed</span></li>
      <li><span class="sticker blush" style="--tilt:5deg">About 30 clients consulted</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <Scribble name="loop" class="cover-loop" />
</section>
<style>
.cover{background:var(--tangerine);color:var(--ink);padding:clamp(40px,7vw,96px) 0 clamp(56px,8vw,112px);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.cover-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,7fr) minmax(0,4fr);gap:40px 64px;align-items:center;position:relative;z-index:1}
.cover h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5.6vw,5rem);margin:0 0 24px;max-width:16ch}
.cover .lede{margin-bottom:34px}
.cover .eyebrow::before{background:var(--ink)}
.cover-stickers{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px 14px;align-content:center;justify-content:flex-start}
.cover-stickers li{max-width:260px}
.cover-stickers .sticker{font-size:1.05rem;padding:12px 20px;display:block}
:global(.cover-loop){position:absolute;right:-60px;bottom:-30px;width:420px;color:rgba(22,22,22,.28);transform:rotate(-8deg)}
@media(max-width:900px){.cover-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cover-stickers{justify-content:flex-start}:global(.cover-loop){width:300px;right:-80px;bottom:-40px}}
</style>
